RES4LYF local patch (hidream/model.py) found on Saya's machine on 2026-10-05 (audit Fable, FO-16): masked attention split by head groups
(~1 GiB each) so the HiDream mask does not materialize ~5 GB of scores. Not upstream. Base: RES4LYF 119679d (2026-05-20).
Apply inside custom_nodes/RES4LYF with: git apply res4lyf_hidream_attention_split.patch

